14. TWELVE PRODUCTION ACCEPTANCE GATES

Every critical workflow must pass the following evidence chain.

Gate	Required proof
1. UI event	Real user interaction
2. Client handler	Correct event execution
3. API route	Actual server request
4. Authentication/RBAC	Authorized and unauthorized tests
5. Tenant isolation	Cross-tenant denial
6. Service logic	Actual business operation
7. Database	Durable transaction
8. External provider	Actual provider response
9. Read-back	Verified persisted result
10. Audit	Recorded action and actor
11. Automated tests	Passing relevant tests
12. Failure/rollback	Safe failure and recovery

Not every workflow requires an external provider. In that case, mark Gate 8 as not applicable with an explanation rather than inventing a provider response.

